        "link": "https://www.liberation.fr/international/moyen-orient/bruler-la-terre-detruire-la-pierre-enquete-sur-leffacement-organise-du-sud-liban-par-larmee-israelienne-20260506_FIA7O7FACBF7VI37232FX4SV4U/",
